
This archive contains the coordinates for the S30L-CI test set. 
They are provided in the following way:

The complexes are numbered according to the provided figure s30l-ci.png.
Each folder contains three subfolders, A for the host, B for the guest 
and AB for the complex. 
The coordinates are provided in the Turbomole format in atomic units.
In case of the complex, the coordinates are sorted in a way that 
host atoms appear first and guest atoms appear second (in the same
order as in the A and B files).

If a charge is present, a .CHRG file in contained in the respective 
folder.

The reference association energies are provided in the file 
references_s30ci. 
